## live turn order (see
## _spawn_monsters_during_exploration()) and back to true once they're
## all defeated and _return_to_exploration_after_combat() resumes the
## same encounter. Always false for a plain combat encounter.
var _exploration_mode: bool = false

## Per the request ("allow opening Character Menu during dungeon
## exploring"): this screen never carried its own Character Menu at
## all — Overworld owns the only instance (see its own `character_menu`
## var), and FieldEncounter is reached via change_scene_to_file(), which
